{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-one-zaabeel","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"one-zaabeel","about":"One Za’abeel Residences, developed by Ithra Dubai, is an architectural landmark nestled in the heart of Zabeel. Completed in 2023, this 59-storey residential tower forms part of the iconic One Za’abeel complex—an integrated development that also features a Grade A office tower and a luxury hotel. With its strategic location and striking design, it offers a distinguished address in one of Dubai’s most prestigious districts.Comprising 264 exquisitely designed units, One Za’abeel Residences offers a curated selection of 1 to 4-bedroom simplexes and duplexes, alongside a singular 5-bedroom penthouse. Residents benefit from an impressive suite of amenities, including a beach-style swimming pool, state-of-the-art fitness centre, spa facilities, lush outdoor gardens, children’s play areas, games rooms, and dedicated valet services—setting a new benchmark for luxurious urban living in Dubai.","price":12300000,"title":"One Zaabeel","bitrix":{"id":113,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"One Za'abeel","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"One Za'abeel","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ithra Dubai","project_location":"Zaabeel"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_zaabeel_feature_1bf6d34a43.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_zaabeel_feature_1bf6d34a43.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2098336,"lng":55.2979659},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one2_6565595789.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one2_6565595789.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_zaabeel_1_042f42cd18.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_zaabeel_1_042f42cd18.webp"},{"340x252":"